:25:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-06-25T23:20:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"BLO1-1-2\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006204\",\"siteId\":\"BLO1\",\"screenId\":\"BLO1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"BLO1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"BLO1-85-HO00006204\"},{\"id\":\"BLO1-100567\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-06-25\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-06-25T21:10:00+01:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-06-25T23:16:00+01:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-06-25T21:35:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-06-25T23:16:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"BLO1-4-5\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006097\",\"siteId\":\"BLO1\",\"screenId\":\"BLO1-4\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"BLO1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"BLO1-83-HO00006097\"}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"BLO1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Bloomsbury\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.5247,\"longitude\":-0.123},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"The Brunswick Centre,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"WC1N 1AW\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006086\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Parthenope\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award-winning fi lmmaker Paolo Sorrentino comes a monumental and deeply romantic story of a lifetime. Born in the Bay of Naples in 1950, Parthenope (Celeste Dalla Porta) searches for happiness over the long summers of her youth, falling in love with her home city and its many memorable characters. But when tragedy strikes, and carefree romances lose their thrill, she decides to seek a deeper sense of purpose. Featuring a captivating performance from Dalla Porta and an outstanding cast that includes Gary Oldman, PARTHENOPE is another tale of great beauty from a master of modern cinema.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award-winning fi lmmaker Paolo Sorrentino comes a monumental and deeply romantic story of a lifetime. Born in the Bay of Naples in 1950, Parthenope (Celeste \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong sex, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-02\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":137,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001876\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001877\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003564\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011053\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011054\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011055\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011056\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011057\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011058\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000156\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000161\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000028\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"821ae2af-6add-4e42-a9c1-26154a473921\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006086\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007505\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Picturehouse Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006097\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Phoenician Scheme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe; Mia Threapleton as Liesl, his daughter/a nun; Michael Cera as Bjorn, their tutor. With: Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qRAnphZLAIg\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001084\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001411\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005699\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eff6ffca-db00-4c6f-9e5e-1783c6ace2d7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006097\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007517\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006166\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: The Encampments\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The student protests that ignited at Columbia University in April 2024 made waves around the world. As the institution tried to shut down the Gaza Solidarity Encampment by force, the student movement grew, sparking encampments at hundreds of other campuses across the US.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith gripping, ground-level footage and intimate interviews with student leaders, THE ENCAMPMENTS charts the growth of the movement, as the students face police raids, disinformation, media attacks and the strongest of threats from the universities themselves.\\r\\n\\r\\nFeaturing detained activist Mahmoud Khalil, alongside professors, whistleblowers, and other student leaders, this timely film captures the deeper stakes of a historic moment that continues to reverberate across the globe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":null,\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-29\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":81,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011282\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011283\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006166\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007605\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006199\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hidden (Caché)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8d52e414-ea56-449f-949a-6cbcfa55a8b7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006199\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007654\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006202\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Art for Everybody\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"For much of the 90s, Thomas Kinkade was America's most successful artist, selling his idealised, kitschy scenes of cosy cottages and welcoming village streets into homes across the country. But behind his much-loved persona as the wholesome 'Painter of Light' were demons that would drive him to alcoholism and scandal.\\r\\n\\r\\nA vault of unseen, unexpectedly dark paintings, discovered only after his death, offers a key to an unknown side of Kinkade, unraveling the chocolate-box life he had presented to a middle America so desperate to buy it.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn ART FOR EVERYBODY, Miranda Yousef peels back the layers of Kinkade’s facade to reveal a more complex and troubled man than his public ever knew.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":null,\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":99,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011414\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006202\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007657\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006203\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Tornado\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation when she and her father’s travelling puppet show crosses paths with a ruthless criminal gang led by Sugarman (PULP FICTION star Tim Roth) and his ambitious son Little Sugar (SLOW HORSES’ Jack Lowden). In an attempt to create a new life, Tornado seizes the opportunity to steal the gold from the gang’s most recent heist; what follows is a thrilling tale of adrenaline-fueled action as Tornado fights to escape a violent demise.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Set in the rugged landscape of 1790’s Britain, Tornado (played by model-songwriter Koki,) finds herself caught in a perilous situation.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003251\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003321\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011415\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011416\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011417\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000252\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000254\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000256\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b32a6015-ac13-48b6-9e04-b64a47c5df98\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006203\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007659\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Lionsgate\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006247\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Porcelain War\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Amidst the chaos and destruction of the brutal Russian invasion of Ukraine, three artists defiantly find inspiration and beauty as they defend their culture and their country. In a war waged by professional soldiers against ordinary civilians, Slava Leontyev, Anya Stasenko, and Andrey Stefanov choose to stay behind, armed with their art, their cameras, and, for the first time in their lives, their guns. Despite daily shelling, Anya finds resistance and purpose in her art, Andrey takes the dangerous journey to get his young family to safety abroad, and Slava becomes a weapons instructor for ordinary people who have become unlikely soldiers. As the war intensifies, Andrey picks up his camera to film their story, and on tiny porcelain figurines, Anya and Slava capture their idyllic past, uncertain present, and hope for the future.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Under roaring fighter jets, Ukrainian artists Slava, Anya, and Andrey choose to stay behind. Defiantly finding beauty amid destruction, they show that although it's easy \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":87,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011554\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011555\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011556\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011557\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011559\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011560\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011561\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006247\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007709\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006253\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Uncropped\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Rediscover the work of James Hamilton, one of the great chroniclers of the cultural history of America. A New York legend himself, Hamilton created iconic images during the heyday of alternative print - from Patti Smith, Liza Minnelli, Lou Reed, Hitchcock, George Romero, to Noah Baumbach and Wes Anderson.\\r\\n\\r\\nA visual chronicle of New York’s zeitgeist over the last 50 years, UNCROPPED subtly traces the rise and fall of photojournalism itself, making it a compelling and visually rich narrative for audiences seeking a deep dive into cultural and photographic history.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":null,\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011583\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006253\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007715\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006210\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Lollipop\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Molly, a young woman released from prison struggles to regain custody of her children. When she bumps into her childhood friend Amina the two women soon realize their only chance is to join forces and take destiny into their own hands.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Molly, a young woman released from prison struggles to regain custody of her children. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005551\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011445\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011446\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011447\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011448\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011449\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011450\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011451\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011452\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011453\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011454\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011455\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c22a02d9-8d70-45ff-ab14-60b81bb23172\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006210\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007666\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Met Film\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006110\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"F1® The Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career. Thirty years later, he’s a nomadic racer-for-hire when he’s approached by his former teammate Ruben Cervantes (Javier Bardem), owner of a struggling FORMULA 1 team that is on the verge of collapse. Ruben convinces Sonny to come back to FORMULA 1 for one last shot at saving the team and being the best in the world. He’ll drive alongside Joshua Pearce (Damson Idris), the team's hotshot rookie intent on setting his own pace. But as the engines roar, Sonny’s past catches up with him and he finds that in FORMULA 1, your teammate is your fiercest competition—and the road to redemption is not something you can travel alone.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":156,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TZGY2CWPXeU\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000166\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000167\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001693\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002986\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003190\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003191\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008544\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008790\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011188\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90334335-0de9-4985-8924-9942f4379b60\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006110\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007538\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000001876\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Silvio\",\"familyName\":\"Orlando\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001877\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Paolo\",\"familyName\":\"Sorrentino\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003564\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ardavan\",\"familyName\":\