\"2025-06-30T21:15:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-06-30T22:56:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"BLO1-1-2\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006097\",\"siteId\":\"BLO1\",\"screenId\":\"BLO1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"BLO1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"BLO1-83-HO00006097\"},{\"id\":\"BLO1-100721\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2025-06-30\",\"startsAt\":\"2025-06-30T21:00:00+01:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2025-06-30T23:20:00+01:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2025-06-30T21:25:00+01:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2025-06-30T23:20:00+01:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"BLO1-4-5\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006204\",\"siteId\":\"BLO1\",\"screenId\":\"BLO1-4\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"BLO1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":null,\"restrictions\":[\"FilmAdvanceBookingRule\"],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":\"BLO1-85-HO00006204\"}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"BLO1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Bloomsbury\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.5247,\"longitude\":-0.123},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"The Brunswick Centre,\",\"line2\":\"London,\",\"city\":\"WC1N 1AW\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00005305\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Film Club: The Watermelon Woman\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"‘The Watermelon Woman’ was the name given to the mythical Fae Richards, a beautiful yet elusive Black actress from the 1930s. In all her films, it was her only billing, why should that be? It is a mystery that perplexes Cheryl (Cheryl Dunye), a young black film maker. She sets out to solve the mystery by making a documentary about this forgotten star.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe Watermelon Woman garnered great critical and audience acclaim, and contains the most notorious lesbian sex scene of its time, (which even saw the film being discussed in Congress). The film is a fiction, but Cheryl Dunye says, “Sometimes you have to create your own history.”\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Drama about a young Black filmmaker researches a forgotten star of 1930s cinema.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008577\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008578\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00005305\",\"hoCode\":\"A000006581\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Peccadillo Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006057\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Riefenstahl\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Explores Leni Riefenstahl's artistic legacy and her complex ties to the Nazi regime, juxtaposing her self-portrayal with evidence suggesting awareness of the regime's atrocities.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Explores Leni Riefenstahl's artistic legacy and her complex ties to the Nazi regime, juxtaposing her self-portrayal with evidence suggesting awareness...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong real violence, discrimination, sexual violence references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010976\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010977\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010978\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010979\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006057\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007473\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006086\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Parthenope\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award-winning fi lmmaker Paolo Sorrentino comes a monumental and deeply romantic story of a lifetime. Born in the Bay of Naples in 1950, Parthenope (Celeste Dalla Porta) searches for happiness over the long summers of her youth, falling in love with her home city and its many memorable characters. But when tragedy strikes, and carefree romances lose their thrill, she decides to seek a deeper sense of purpose. Featuring a captivating performance from Dalla Porta and an outstanding cast that includes Gary Oldman, PARTHENOPE is another tale of great beauty from a master of modern cinema.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"From Academy Award-winning fi lmmaker Paolo Sorrentino comes a monumental and deeply romantic story of a lifetime. Born in the Bay of Naples in 1950, Parthenope (Celeste \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong sex, language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-02\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":137,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001876\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001877\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003564\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011053\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011054\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011055\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011056\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011057\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011058\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000156\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000161\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000028\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"821ae2af-6add-4e42-a9c1-26154a473921\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006086\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007505\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Picturehouse Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006097\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Phoenician Scheme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe; Mia Threapleton as Liesl, his daughter/a nun; Michael Cera as Bjorn, their tutor. With: Riz Ahmed, Tom Hanks, Bryan Cranston, Mathieu Amalric, Richard Ayoade, Jeffrey Wright, Scarlett Johansson, Benedict Cumberbatch, Rupert Friend, Hope Davis.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The story of a family and a family business. Starring: Benicio del Toro as Zsa-zsa Korda, one of the richest men in Europe.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong injury detail\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-05-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":101,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qRAnphZLAIg\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001084\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001275\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001395\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001400\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001409\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001410\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001411\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002527\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005645\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005698\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005699\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011116\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011117\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"eff6ffca-db00-4c6f-9e5e-1783c6ace2d7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006097\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007517\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006199\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Hidden (Caché)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A married couple is terrorized by a series of surveillance videotapes left on their front porch.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004195\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011332\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011334\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011380\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011394\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011412\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"8d52e414-ea56-449f-949a-6cbcfa55a8b7\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006199\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007654\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Curzon\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006204\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Academy Award®-winning director Danny Boyle and Academy Award®-nominated writer Alex Garland reunite for 28 Years Later, a terrifying new story set in the world created by 28 Days Later. It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine, some have found ways to exist amidst the infected. One such group of survivors lives on a small island connected to the mainland by a single, heavily-defended causeway. When one of the group leaves the island on a mission into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It’s been almost three decades since the rage virus escaped a biological weapons laboratory, and now, still in a ruthlessly enforced quarantine...\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":115,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=poEFz8Ivzug\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001100\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001270\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003206\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003678\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004531\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010558\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011257\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000030\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7823fd3-66f7-47af-87ba-d36ef45b168c\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006204\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007660\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Sony Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006215\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Ran (40th Anniversary)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Medieval Japan, an elderly warlord retires, handing over his empire to his three sons. However, he vastly underestimates how the new-found power will corrupt them and cause them to turn on each other...and him.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Medieval Japan, an elderly warlord retires, handing over his empire to his three sons. However, he vastly underestimates how the new-found power will corrupt them.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-27\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":161,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003969\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009033\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011481\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011482\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011483\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011484\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011485\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011486\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011487\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011488\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000036\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"83bc0a5a-d0fb-424a-90e7-a799ebf5230e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006215\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007671\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Studio Canal\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006252\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Sudan, Remember Us\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In 2019, documentary filmmaker Hind Meddab flew to Sudan to film a sit-in protest at the Army headquarters in Khartoum. The people of Sudan were assembling, demanding reform after decades of military dictatorship. There she met a selection of young activists that she would continue to film over the course of 4 years, from the swell of hope and accomplishment following dictator Omar al-Bashir’s fall to the oppression of the military crackdown and subsequent civil war, which today, leaves Sudan in ruins.\\r\\n\\r\\nStanding in front of a powerful army, how could the civilian movement find the strength to persist? In conversations, in demonstrations, on walls, it emerges how the Sudanese tradition for poetry becomes a powerful tool for activism. Art, music and poetry bolster every stage of the Sudanese fight for freedom. SUDAN, REMEMBER US bears witness to a lost revolution and within it unearths a tribute to the power of creativity as a tool of survival and resistance.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In a Sudan torn apart by years of war, this documentary immerses us in the daily fight of young Sudanese. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-27\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":76,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011581\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011582\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006252\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007714\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006253\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"DocHouse: Uncropped\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Rediscover the work of James Hamilton, one of the great chroniclers of the cultural history of America. A New York legend himself, Hamilton created iconic images during the heyday of alternative print - from Patti Smith, Liza Minnelli, Lou Reed, Hitchcock, George Romero, to Noah Baumbach and Wes Anderson.\\r\\n\\r\\nA visual chronicle of New York’s zeitgeist over the last 50 years, UNCROPPED subtly traces the rise and fall of photojournalism itself, making it a compelling and visually rich narrative for audiences seeking a deep dive into cultural and photographic history.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":null,\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-20\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011583\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006253\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007715\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"DocHouse\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006210\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Lollipop\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Molly, a young woman released from prison struggles to regain custody of her children. When she bumps into her childhood friend Amina the two women soon realize their only chance is to join forces and take destiny into their own hands.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Molly, a young woman released from prison struggles to regain custody of her children. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":100,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005551\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011445\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011446\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011447\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011448\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011449\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011450\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011451\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011452\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011453\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011454\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011455\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c22a02d9-8d70-45ff-ab14-60b81bb23172\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006210\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007666\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Met Film\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006211\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"From Hilde, With Love\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Berlin, 1942. A shy Hilde falls in love with Hans and gradually finds her place in the \\nresistance group that would come to be known as the “Red Orchestra”. Together, \\nthey spend a beautiful summer where their relationship entwines with quiet acts \\nof defiance. But when the Gestapo arrests members of the group, Hilde and Hans \\nare among their numbers and must find the strength to confront their situation. \\nInspired by an incredible true story set against the backdrop of a country torn by \\nconflict, FROM HILDE, WITH LOVE is a powerful tale of love and resistance. \",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Inspired by an incredible true story set against the backdrop of a country torn by \\nconflict, FROM HILDE, WITH LOVE is a powerful tale of love and resistance. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-27\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":125,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007133\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011456\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011457\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011458\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011459\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011460\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011461\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b19e5bb9-996d-4ea7-b588-04b4f0aa48da\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006211\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007667\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Picturehouse Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006110\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"F1® The Movie\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career. Thirty years later, he’s a nomadic racer-for-hire when he’s approached by his former teammate Ruben Cervantes (Javier Bardem), owner of a struggling FORMULA 1 team that is on the verge of collapse. Ruben convinces Sonny to come back to FORMULA 1 for one last shot at saving the team and being the best in the world. He’ll drive alongside Joshua Pearce (Damson Idris), the team's hotshot rookie intent on setting his own pace. But as the engines roar, Sonny’s past catches up with him and he finds that in FORMULA 1, your teammate is your fiercest competition—and the road to redemption is not something you can travel alone.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Dubbed “the greatest that never was,” Sonny Hayes (Brad Pitt) was FORMULA 1’s most promising phenom of the 1990s until an accident on the track nearly ended his career.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate threat\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":156,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TZGY2CWPXeU\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000166\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000167\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001693\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002986\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003190\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003191\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004240\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008544\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008790\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011186\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011187\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011188\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"90334335-0de9-4985-8924-9942f4379b60\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006110\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007538\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000008577\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Cheryl\",\"familyName\":\"Dunye\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000008578\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Guinevere\",\"familyName\":\"Turner\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000010976\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Leni\",\"familyName\":\"Riefenstahl\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000010977\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ulrich\",\"familyName\":\"Noethen\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000010978\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Andres\",\"familyName\":\"Veiel\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000010979\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Sandra\",\"familyName\":\"Maischberger\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001876\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Silvio\",\"familyName\":\"Orlando\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000001877\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Paolo\",\"familyName\":\"Sorrentino\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003564\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Ardavan\",\"familyName\":\"Safaee\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000011053\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Gary\",\"familyName\":\"Oldman\",\"middleName\":n