nephew. Hans-Peter has been transformed into a Nutcracker.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":210,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000292\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b3549712-da50-415c-811f-783459340cae\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006228\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007685\",\"eventId\":\"0000000042\",\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"HO00000292\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Peter \",\"familyName\":\"Wright\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000006\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Documentary\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"VS00000007\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"TBC\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"TBC - Adults.\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[{\"id\":\"0000000003\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Live event\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"Live\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Live Via Satellite\",\"translations\":[]},\"importantMessage\":null,\"displayPriority\":100,\"isPromoted\":false}],\"screens\":[{\"id\":\"BLO1-5\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Renoir Screen\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"0000000042\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Royal Ballet and Opera\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"RB&O\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"The Royal Ballet and Opera brings the thrill of world-class theatre to cinema screens right around the globe. \\n\\nWith productions across both Companies, the programme includes beloved classics as well as new productions.\\n\\nOffering audiences a view from the best seat in the house, the programme shares the joy of live performance, and the beauty of world-class art with cinemagoers in 